                                "sense_id": "33cd44b4-0702-3f69-8159-458710551d62",
                                "text": "Close to this monument is another, the stateliest and most sumptuous of the three; it first arrests the eye of the stranger, and long detains it, — a many-pinnacled pile, surrounded by niches with statues of the warrior saints."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2da3911a-8dae-49c0-aa79-2391faea42bd",
                                "sense_id": "33cd44b4-0702-3f69-8159-458710551d62",
                                "text": "Photography from the bluff side would accentuate the twin-pinnacled crest but sacrifice part of the background."
                            }
